m_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-08-31T13:02:13.082Z"},{"id":"l3HP2jeko","title":"Watering Hole Attacks Push ScanBox Keylogger","url":"https://threatpost.com/watering-hole-attacks-push-scanbox-keylogger/180490/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/watering-hole-attacks-push-scanbox-keylogger-l3hp2jeko","summary":"The advanced threat group (APT) is targeted messages that supposedly link back to Australian news websites. The group has, in the past, expanded well beyond Australasia. It has \u201cstolen trade secrets and confidential business information\u2019 from victims in the United States, Austria, Cambodia, Canada, Germany, Indonesia, Malaysia, Norway, Saudi Arabia,","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/949a6a1ad00df945ec449d0aaa35914a","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-08-30T16:02:22.546Z"},{"id":"IHAEDXPSE","title":"Tentacles of \u20180ktapus\u2019 Threat Group Victimize 130 Firms","url":"https://threatpost.com/0ktapus-victimize-130-firms/180487/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/tentacles-of-0ktapus-threat-group-victimize-130-firms-ihaedxpse","summary":"Threat Group Victimize 130 Firms Targeted attacks on Twilio and Cloudflare employees are tied to a massive phishing campaign that resulted in 9,931 accounts at over 130 organizations being compromised. Impacted were 114 US-based firms, with additional victims of sprinkled across 68 additional countries.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/c1fb471686b9e51d070f7aa76b9180b3","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-08-29T14:58:35.075Z"},{"id":"mQ3CiQWK0","title":"Ransomware Attacks are on the Rise","url":"https://threatpost.com/ransomware-attacks-are-on-the-rise/180481/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/ransomware-attacks-are-on-the-rise-mq3ciqwk0","summary":"Ransomware attacks are back on the rise after a recent dip, according to data released by NCC Group. The resurgence is being led by old ransomware-as-a-service (RaaS) groups. Lockbit was by far the most prolific ransomware gang in July, behind 62 attacks.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/0d86770db7a015146f65d380696f51d6","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-08-26T16:49:28.565Z"},{"id":"ZXok9aEL0","title":"Cybercriminals Are Selling Access to Chinese Surveillance Cameras","url":"https://threatpost.com/cybercriminals-are-selling-access-to-chinese-surveillance-cameras/180478/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/cybercriminals-are-selling-access-to-chinese-surveillance-cameras-zxok9ael0","summary":"New research indicates that over 80,000 cameras in the world are vulnerable to an 11 month-old command injection flaw. Hikvision cameras are a Chinese state-owned manufacturer of video surveillance equipment. The extent of the damage done already is unclear.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/b9cd97bb3b6892f5c1e471c23948f233","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-08-25T18:49:04.855Z"},{"id":"oGDCFY6-U","title":"Twitter Whistleblower Complaint: The TL;DR Version","url":"https://threatpost.com/twitter-whistleblower-tldr-version/180472/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/twitter-whistleblower-complaint-the-tl-dr-version-ogdcfy6-u","summary":"Twitter\u2019s former head of security Peiter \u2018Mudge\u2019 Zatko accused Twitter of a litany of poor security and privacy practices that together constituted a national security risk. The company is out of compliance with a 2010 FTC order to protect users\u2019 personal information.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/5c8336ce477e89c216754c370539c2c6","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-08-24T14:21:05.180Z"},{"id":"Dq1pGd_ds","title":"Firewall Bug Under Active Attack Triggers CISA Warning","url":"https://threatpost.com/firewall-bug-under-active-attack-cisa-warning/180467/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/firewall-bug-under-active-attack-triggers-cisa-warning-dq1pgd-ds","summary":"The flaw could be used by remote hackers to carry out reflected and amplified denial-of-service (DoS) attacks without having to authenticate targeted systems. Palo Alto Networks maintains the flaw can only be exploited on a limited number of systems. Federal agencies urged to patch the bug by September 9.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/a40d8e63adc7e8dbb764213843a2a0c9","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-08-23T13:22:10.290Z"},{"id":"y5uK4fEH2","title":"Fake Reservation Links Prey on Weary Travelers","url":"https://threatpost.com/reservation-links-prey-on-travelers/180462/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/fake-reservation-links-prey-on-weary-travelers-y5uk4feh2","summary":"A longtime threat group identified as TA558 has ramped up efforts to target the travel and hospitality industries. Security researchers say TA558 cybercriminals have revamped their 2018 campaigns with fake reservation emails that contain links \u2013 that if clicked \u2013 deliver a malicious malware payload containing a potpourri of malware variants.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/b56c48ebd53c30f901eccf4df7caba81","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2022-08-22T14:00:39.353Z"},{"id":"BLXLDS0iH","title":"iPhone Users Urged to Update to Patch 2 Zero-Days Under Attack","url":"https://threatpost.com/iphone-users-urged-to-update-to-patch-2-zero-days-under-attack/180448/","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/iphone-users-urged-to-update-to-patch-2-zero-days-under-attack-blxlds0ih","summary":"iOS 15.6.1 and Monterey 12.5.1 both patch the two flaws, which basically impact any Apple device that can run either iOS 15 or the Monterey version of its desktop OS. The patches are for vulnerabilities that allow attackers to execute arbitrary code and ulti